         fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element `Composition.url` has a context of Composition based on following the parent source element upwards and mapping to `Composition`.\nElement `Composition.url` has no mapping targets in FHIR R4. Typically, this is because the element has been added (is a new element).\nCan be a urn:uuid: or a urn:oid: but real http: addresses are preferred. Multiple instances may share the same URL if they have a distinct version." ]
